<title>USA: Vornado buys four NY properties for $26 mln.</title>
<headline>Vornado buys four NY properties for $26 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SADDLE BROOK, N.J. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vornado Realty Trust said on Monday that it bought four properties in Manhattan previously owned by affiliates of the Riese Organization for $26 million.</p>
<p>Vornado is also making a $41 million mortgage loan to Riese affiliates cross collateralized by 10 other Manhattan properties.</p>
<p>Vornado Realty Trust is a fully integrated equity real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
